# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere. Without this,
# GitHub Actions Windows runners (core.autocrlf=true) check out LF text as
# CRLF, which breaks the golden sha pins and the LF-anchored patch patterns
# in the fixture tests (they run on every CI leg).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary fixture types must never be line-normalized or filtered.
*.deb binary
*.dylib binary
*.ipa binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.xz binary
*.bz2 binary
*.zst binary
*.framework binary
*.bin binary
